# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# Every file here was authored with LF. Without this, Git's Windows default
# (`core.autocrlf=true`) rewrites them to CRLF in the working copy, which makes
# a fresh clone differ from the committed tree and shows up as spurious diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.tgz binary
